{Three rarer openings, each in under 3% of 1.d4 games on Lichess: the Dutch Defense (1...f5), the Budapest Gambit (1...Nf6 2.c4 e5) and White's Colle System (1...d5 2.Nf3 Nf6 3.e3).}
1. d4 *
